OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with clear spells. Staying dry
OL,7,Fwith largely clear skies overnight.
OL,8,FThis leads to a widespread frost and
OL,9,Fallows some fog patches to form.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAfter a cold start it will be
OL,12,Fa dry and bright or sunny morning. It
OL,13,Fwill turn cloudier from the south
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon with perhaps the
OL,15,Fodd evening shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
