OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA good
OL,6,Fdeal of dry, albeit occasionally
OL,7,Fcloudy weather through the period
OL,8,Falongside some mist and fog patches.
OL,9,FChance of a few coastal showers at
OL,10,Ftimes.
